# Sonarr divergence: s6-overlay v3 oneshot `up` files are execlineb (each line a separate
# exec call); the bash logic lives at /etc/s6-overlay/scripts/init-mangarr-config and is
# dispatched via /command/with-contenv (which sources env from /var/run/s6/container_environment
# then execs the rest). Pattern verified against linuxserver + hotio s6-overlay v3 images.
# Locally we caught the prior `set -e`-in-up bug as "unable to exec set: No such file or directory"
# (exit 127) during smoke-test of the built mangarr:local-test image.
/command/with-contenv bash /etc/s6-overlay/scripts/init-mangarr-config
